senses.gloss:
अक्रिय अ-क्रिय, अस्, आ, अम्, without works;
inactive, torpid; abstaining from religious rites; good
for nothing; (आ), f. inactivity; neglect of duty.

आ-क्रन्द, अस्, m. calling, crying, crying out;
shouting; weeping, sobbing; sound; war-cry; furious
or violent combat; war, battle; violence; a friend;
a brother; a king, a lord; usurper; a king who
prevents an ally from aiding another; (अस्, आ, अम्),
one who checks or restrains.

आ-क्रुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, scolded, reviled; vociferated;
abused, calumniated, accused; cursed; (अम्), n. call-
ing out.

आ-क्रोश, अस्, m. calling or crying out, vociferation;
scolding, reviling, blaming, censuring, abuse; a curse
or oath.
